Description: A modern BitTorrent client
 vTorrent is a feature-rich, cross-platform BitTorrent client built
 with modern technologies. It provides a clean and intuitive user
 interface while offering powerful functionality for managing torrents.
 .
 Features include:
  * Modern, responsive UI with light and dark themes
  * DHT (Distributed Hash Table) for trackerless torrents
  * Magnet link support
  * Intelligent bandwidth management
  * Sequential downloading for media files
  * Peer exchange (PEX) support
  * uTP protocol support
  * IP filtering and encryption
